flowchart TD
    A([Consumer calls · 2 rings]) --> B[Inbound Call Node<br/>4 APIs on the calling number]
    B --> C[Default<br/>greet · classify · switchagent]
    C --> D{Target needs<br/>consumer data?}

    D -->|No — newConnectionAgent<br/>emergencyAgent| E[Switch straight through]
    D -->|Yes| F{RefillStatusReturnCode<br/>== 801?}

    F -->|No — data available| G[GATE<br/>eligibility / state check]
    F -->|Yes — no data| H[getConsumerDetails<br/>ask mobile no. · bpcl_fetch_all_api]

    H -->|data returned| G
    H -->|no data| I([calltransfer → human agent])

    G --> J[Correct specialist variant<br/>+ enriched handoffSummary]
    E --> J

    J --> K{Next query<br/>off-topic?}
    K -->|Yes| L[routingAgent] --> D
    K -->|No| M([Handled by that agent])
